  "description": "Joon-hwi has always been a beta. Which is a relief, given how his best friend and nationally beloved actor Seok-hyun hates omegas, and there’s no way Joon-hwi’s crush on him would be requited otherwise. But one day, when Joon-hwi discovers he might be the exact thing Seok-hyunh hates, everything spirals out of control… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: Includes a prologue.*",
